        "name": "Throw",
        "desc": "Adam throws a creature Grappled by him to a space he can see within 30 feet of himself that isn't in the air. dex DC 18, the creature thrown and each creature in the destination space.  13 (2d6 + 6) Bludgeoning damage, and the target has the Prone condition.  Half damage only."
      }
